DESCRIPTION:New Year's Day falls on January 1\, which is an administrative 
 decision rather than a fact of nature. The date has been moved\, abandoned
 \, and restored more than once in Western Europe — Britain and its Ameri
 can colonies did not adopt it until 1752 — and most of what Americans ac
 tually do on the day\, from the parade in Pasadena to the ball in Times Sq
 uare\, was invented between 1788 and 1907.\n\nhttps://todaycelebrates.com/
 holiday/new-years-day/
